exports[`onboarding template print sheet > renders the reference blank checklist byte-for-byte 1`] = `"<div class="onb-sheet"><header class="onb-head"><img src="/src/assets/practice-logo.png" alt="Northfield Dental Group" class="onb-logo"/><div class="onb-head-meta"><p class="onb-title">Onboarding Checklist</p><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Role</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Front Desk</span></div><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Checklist</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Front Desk Onboarding (starter)</span></div></div></header><div class="onb-who"><span class="onb-who-slot"><span class="onb-who-line"></span><span class="onb-who-label">Team member</span></span><span class="onb-who-slot"><span class="onb-who-line"></span><span class="onb-who-label">Start date</span></span></div><div class="onb-legend"><span>Each item is signed off twice: by the trainer and by the new team member.</span><span class="onb-legend-cols"><span>Trainer</span><span>Team member</span></span></div><section class="onb-section"><h2 class="onb-section-title">First-Day Paperwork</h2><div class="onb-item"><div class="onb-item-text"><p class="onb-item-title">Employment forms completed and returned</p></div><div class="onb-item-signs"><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-line"></span><span class="onb-sign-label">Initials / date</span></span><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-line"></span><span class="onb-sign-label">Initials / date</span></span></div></div><div class="onb-item"><div class="onb-item-text"><p class="onb-item-title">Payroll and direct deposit set up</p></div><div class="onb-item-signs"><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-line"></span><span class="onb-sign-label">Initials / date</span></span><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-line"></span><span class="onb-sign-label">Initials / date</span></span></div></div><div class="onb-item"><div class="onb-item-text"><p class="onb-item-title