exports[`onboarding template print sheet > the record sheet prints initials, dates, and verification status per side 1`] = `"<div class="onb-sheet"><header class="onb-head"><img src="/src/assets/practice-logo.png" alt="Northfield Dental Group" class="onb-logo"/><div class="onb-head-meta"><p class="onb-title">Onboarding Record</p><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Team member</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Hire Probe</span></div><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Role</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Front Desk</span></div><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Checklist</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Front Desk Onboarding (starter)</span></div><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Started</span><span class="onb-meta-value">Aug 20, 2026</span></div><div class="onb-meta-item"><span class="onb-meta-key">Status</span><span class="onb-meta-value">In progress</span></div></div></header><div class="onb-legend"><span>Each item is signed off twice: by the trainer and by the new team member. PIN-verified sign-offs were confirmed with that person&#x27;s server-checked PIN.</span><span class="onb-legend-cols"><span>Trainer</span><span>Team member</span></span></div><section class="onb-section"><h2 class="onb-section-title">Basics</h2><div class="onb-item"><div class="onb-item-text"><p class="onb-item-title">Verified both ways</p></div><div class="onb-item-signs"><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-value">TRN</span><span class="onb-sign-meta">Aug 21, 2026</span><span class="onb-sign-meta">PIN verified</span></span><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-value">NEW</span><span class="onb-sign-meta">Aug 21, 2026</span><span class="onb-sign-meta">PIN verified</span></span></div></div><div class="onb-item"><div class="onb-item-text"><p class="onb-item-title">Initials fallback, one side open</p></div><div class="onb-item-signs"><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-value">TRN</span><span class="onb-sign-meta">Aug 22, 2026</span><span class="onb-sign-meta onb-unverified">initials only — unverified</span></span><span class="onb-sign-slot"><span class="onb-sign-line"></span><span class="onb-sign-label">Initials / date</span></span></div></div></section><p class="onb-foot">Northfield Dental Group, LLC · Onboarding record — retained in the team member&#x27;s employment file.</p><footer class="onb-footer"><span class="onb-footer-item">41 Northfield Avenue, Springvale, MA 02100</span><span class="onb-footer-item">(555) 010-0142</span><span class="onb-footer-item">northfielddentalgroup.example</span></footer></div>"`;
